#testing

###
# 1) Reset pages indexer (forces full recrawl)
POST https://{{searchService}}.search.windows.net/indexers/{{index-prefix}}-pages-indexer/reset?api-version=2026-05-01-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
# 2) Run pages indexer
POST https://{{searchService}}.search.windows.net/indexers/{{index-prefix}}-pages-indexer/run?api-version=2026-05-01-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
# 3) Get indexer status (includes lastResult + executionHistory)
GET https://{{searchService}}.search.windows.net/indexers/{{index-prefix}}-pages-indexer/status?api-version=2026-05-01-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
# 4) Get indexer definition (optional sanity check)
GET https://{{searchService}}.search.windows.net/indexers/{{index-prefix}}-pages-indexer?api-version=2026-05-01-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
# 5) Get pages datasource definition (optional sanity check)
GET https://{{searchService}}.search.windows.net/datasources/{{index-prefix}}-pages-datasource?api-version=2026-05-01-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
# 6) Debug query: check Home.aspx exists in index (elevated read)
GET https://{{searchService}}.search.windows.net/indexes/{{index-prefix}}-chunks-index/docs?search=Home.aspx&$count=true&$top=5&$select=metadata_spo_item_name,metadata_spo_item_weburi,metadata_spo_item_path&api-version=2026-05-01-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-ms-enable-elevated-read: true